From 14d231f808b4ca692f1f8e366842aea0582b534d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Z User <z@container>
Date: Tue, 17 Mar 2026 02:26:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] feat: Add secure debug console for iPad diagnostics

- Created secure-logger.ts with automatic sensitive data filtering
- Filters passwords, tokens, emails, phone numbers, student names
- Limits memory usage (max 500 logs, truncated messages)
- Added /admin/debug page with full console capture
- Features: real-time logs, filtering by level, export to file
- System info display (browser, memory, timezone, connection)
- Start/stop capture controls, clear logs, copy to clipboard
- Admin-only access with authentication check
- Added link in admin panel for easy access
